<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλο-πρόσαλλος</span></b> , ὁ,
		i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλοτε πρὸς ἄλλον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leaning first to one side, then to
				the other, fickle</i>, epith. of Ares, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.831
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				889
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.496
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῦτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					15.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.34
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>”
				<i>respect of persons, Corp. Herm.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply,
				<i>transferred</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.
			ἀρωγή</span>, coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτεραλκέα
				νίκην</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				565
			</span></i>; <i>deceitful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				46.4
			</span></i>, al.; <i>changeful, successive</i>, of waves, etc. (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλεπάλληλος</span>), ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.24
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				5.68
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
